      "contentPreview": "PARKED-1 [Minor, but the sharpest] \u2014 a hand-edited merge.config with conflictDir \u0022.\u0022 or \u0022\u0022 makes the driver write a .gitignore containing \u0022*\u0022 into the ARTIFACT directory itself. Nmp2ConflictHandler\u0027s IsWithin returns true on equality, so Path.Combine(dirFull, \u0022.\u0022) resolves conflictDir to dirFull, and the driver writes .scrinia/memories/local/.gitignore containing \u0022*\u0022 \u2014 silently ignoring every untracked memory in that directory and below, and clobbering any user .gitignore there. RULING: real but",
